OL,3,GNEWSA'I lost my parents to the same
OL,4,Acancer and fear for my future'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Rebecca Bird's dad died of
OL,7,Fpancreatic cancer, just years after her
OL,8,Fmum died of the same disease, she was
OL,9,Fleft scared for her future.
OL,11,FShe had noticed her dad suffering from
OL,12,Fsimilar symptoms to her mum, but by the
OL,13,Ftime he was diagnosed, it was too late
OL,14,Ffor him to receive treatment.
OL,16,FAccording to Pancreatic Cancer UK,
OL,17,Fseven in 10 people with the disease
OL,18,Freceive no treatment while existing
OL,19,Ftreatment options are often too
OL,20,Fintensive for patients to tolerate.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
