OL,3,GNEWSA'I lost my parents to the same
OL,4,Acancer and fear for my future'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBird, 43, from Felixstowe in Suffolk,
OL,7,Ffeared she might similarly develop this
OL,8,Fcancer and had been left frustrated at
OL,9,Fthe lack of treatment options available
OL,10,Fto patients.
